/Title (Research consistently suggests that meaningful culture change takes three to five years. The broader culture and behaviour requirements do not have a separate transition period - they apply from October 2026. The Regulator is unlikely to expect complete transformation by then, but it will expect to see that the work has started, that there is a credible plan, and that progress is demonstrable.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 444 0 R
