864 0 obj
<<
/Title (Test what you already have. Ask five resident-facing colleagues to describe the behaviours expected of them - without looking anything up. If the answers are consistent and grounded in real experience, that is a strong foundation to build on. If they vary widely, that is useful information about where to focus.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 677 0 R
/Prev 824 0 R
/First 873 0 R
/Last 873 0 R
/Count -1
/Next 865 0 R
>>
endobj
