<<
/Title (How was your current code of conduct developed? Does it reflect your organisation's actual culture and context?)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 677 0 R
/Prev 864 0 R
/Next 825 0 R
>>
endobj
866 0 obj
<<
/Title (The standard explicitly requires that residents have meaningful opportunities to influence and scrutinise the code of conduct. Consultation can range from reviewing a finished document to shaping something from the beginning. The standard is explicit that it expects residents to have shaped the code of conduct - not just reviewed it.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 760 0 R
/Prev 827 0 R
/First 874 0 R
/Last 874 0 R
/Count -1
/Next 875 0 R
>>
endobj
