<<
/Title (Review how your current code of conduct was developed. If residents were involved, at what stage? The earlier residents are part of the conversation, the closer the process sits to what the standard describes as meaningful influence. Reviewing a finished document and shaping one from the start are different things - the standard is clear about which it expects.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 760 0 R
/Prev 866 0 R
